0,Air Tamajeq language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Air_Tamajeq_language,Language family. Afro-Asiatic.Air Tamajeq (Tayərt) is a variety of Tuareg. It is spoken by the Tuareg people inhabiting the Aïr Mountains of the Agadez Region in Niger. Ethnologue lists two dialects: Air (Tayərt) and Tanassfarwat (Tamagarast/Taməsgərəst).,"Tamajeq, Tayart",Afro-Asiatic
